Z||000003||Monkeyman||09-01-2000||01:12 PM||||IRM is the only place I've seen with those Integrated Rocker Panels.  Barbara (@IRM) is sending me some real pics (as opposed to the copy of a copy scans that everyone knows about) of them soon.  I'll post them as I get them.  I've only seen them in person once.  That got me hooked.  I wasn't sure I wanted to spend that kind of $$, but unless I find some really cool scoops before spring, that's what I'll probably get.  The definitely look killer/sweet/groovy/wild.<P>Spike--Don't feel bad about the scoop cost/car cost ratio.  The cost of the scoops (in USD) is $200 <B>more</B> than what I paid for my car!||||reg||1
